{"seq":1,"slug":"event-tracking-design","title":"事件埋点设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/analytics-fundamentals/event-tracking-design","wordCount":1564,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"事件埋点设计\">事件埋点设计</h1><p>移动应用每一次用户交互都是一个潜在的数据信号。事件埋点（Event Tracking）的本质是在代码运行路径中插入结构化的数据采集点，将用户行为转化为可分析的离散事件流。一套设计良好的埋点体系应当在 18 个月内无需重构——这要求从命名规范、参数标准到上报策略的系统性设计，而非需求驱动的逐条堆砌。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>事件埋点围绕三个基本构件展开：<strong>事件</strong>（发生了什么）、<strong>属性</strong>（在什么上下文中发生）和<strong>身份</strong>（谁触发了它）。事件是不可变的事实记录——一旦发生即写入时间线，不可修改只可追加。属性提供事件发生的维度信息，身份将离散事件串联为用户旅程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件模型与分类法\">事件模型与分类法</h2><p>事件分类法（Event Taxonomy）是埋点体系的骨架。业界在 2026 年的共识是采用三层分级命名：<code>{category}_{object}_{action}</code>，使用 <code>snake_case</code>、全小写、无缩写。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Category</td>\n<td>产品功能域</td>\n<td><code>ecommerce</code>, <code>content</code>, <code>account</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Object</td>\n<td>交互对象</td>\n<td><code>product</code>, <code>article</code>, <code>form</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Action</td>\n<td>用户动作（过去时）</td>\n<td><code>viewed</code>, <code>clicked</code>, <code>submitted</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>组合后产生如 <code>ecommerce_product_viewed</code>、<code>account_login_failed</code> 这样自解释的事件名。统一的动词时态（推荐过去时，因为事件描述已发生的事实）消除了团队内部争论。</p>\n<p>事件参数（Properties）同样需要标准化。核心参数分为三类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>通用参数</strong>（每个事件自动携带）：<code>timestamp</code>、<code>session_id</code>、<code>user_id</code>、<code>device_model</code>、<code>os_version</code>、<code>app_version</code></li>\n<li><strong>业务参数</strong>（按 category 预定义）：<code>product_id</code>、<code>price</code>、<code>currency</code>、<code>screen_name</code></li>\n<li><strong>自定义参数</strong>（开发者按需扩展）：需通过 schema registry 注册后方可使用</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参数类型一致性是数据质量的基石。同一参数 <code>price</code> 在 A 事件中传 string <code>&quot;19.99&quot;</code> 而在 B 事件中传 number <code>19.99</code>，下游聚合必然出错。通过 JSON Schema 或 Protocol Buffers 定义事件 contract，在 SDK 侧做编译期校验：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ProductViewedEvent {&#10;  event: &#39;ecommerce_product_viewed&#39;;&#10;  properties: {&#10;    product_id: string;&#10;    price: number;&#10;    currency: &#39;USD&#39; | &#39;CNY&#39; | &#39;EUR&#39;;&#10;    category: string;&#10;    source_screen: string;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProductViewedEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  event</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ecommerce_product_viewed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  properties</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    product_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    price</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'USD'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'CNY'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'EUR'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    category</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    source_screen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"埋点模式-代码埋点-可视化埋点与全埋点\">埋点模式：代码埋点、可视化埋点与全埋点</h2><p>三种埋点模式各有适用场景，实际项目通常混合使用：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[埋点需求] --&gt; B{精度要求}&#10;    B --&gt;|高精度+自定义参数| C[代码埋点]&#10;    B --&gt;|快速验证+无需发版| D[可视化埋点]&#10;    B --&gt;|全量行为回溯| E[全埋点/无埋点]&#10;    C --&gt; F[SDK API 调用]&#10;    D --&gt; G[后台圈选元素]&#10;    E --&gt; H[自动采集点击/曝光]&#10;    F --&gt; I[事件流]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; I\">flowchart LR\n    A[埋点需求] --&gt; B{精度要求}\n    B --&gt;|高精度+自定义参数| C[代码埋点]\n    B --&gt;|快速验证+无需发版| D[可视化埋点]\n    B --&gt;|全量行为回溯| E[全埋点/无埋点]\n    C --&gt; F[SDK API 调用]\n    D --&gt; G[后台圈选元素]\n    E --&gt; H[自动采集点击/曝光]\n    F --&gt; I[事件流]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; I</pre><p><strong>代码埋点</strong>（Code Tracking）在业务逻辑中显式调用 SDK API，精度最高、参数最灵活，但依赖发版迭代。关键事件（注册、付费、核心转化）必须走代码埋点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"Analytics.track(&quot;ecommerce_purchase_completed&quot;, properties: [&#10;    &quot;order_id&quot;: orderId,&#10;    &quot;total_amount&quot;: totalAmount,&#10;    &quot;payment_method&quot;: method.rawValue,&#10;    &quot;item_count&quot;: items.count&#10;])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Analytics.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">track</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ecommerce_purchase_completed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">properties</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orderId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"total_amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalAmount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"payment_method\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> method.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rawValue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"item_count\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> items.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>可视化埋点</strong>（Visual Tracking）通过后台圈选 UI 元素生成埋点规则，下发到客户端匹配。优势是无需发版即可新增埋点，局限是只能采集交互事件且参数受限于可自动提取的 UI 属性。</p>\n<p><strong>全埋点</strong>（Auto-tracking）自动采集所有点击、页面浏览、曝光事件。数据量大但噪声高，适合行为回溯分析。需要注意：全埋点与隐私合规存在天然张力——采集了用户未明确同意的交互数据可能违反 GDPR 的数据最小化原则（参见 <a href=\"../platform-operations/data-privacy-consent\">数据隐私与合规</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"客户端-sdk-上报策略\">客户端 SDK 上报策略</h2><p>移动端网络环境不稳定，事件不应实时逐条上报，而是采用本地持久化 + 批量发送的策略。典型的上报调度机制由三个触发器控制：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>flush</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>interval</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>threshold</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>lifecycle</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{flush}} = \\min(T_{\\text{interval}},\\ T_{\\text{threshold}},\\ T_{\\text{lifecycle}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">flush</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">interval</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">threshold</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lifecycle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>interval</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{interval}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">interval</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为定时器周期（通常 60s），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>threshold</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{threshold}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">threshold</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为缓冲区事件数达到阈值（如 50 条），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>lifecycle</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{lifecycle}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">lifecycle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为应用生命周期事件（进入后台、即将终止）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定时刷新</td>\n<td>60s</td>\n<td>常规使用期间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓冲区满</td>\n<td>50–100 条</td>\n<td>高频交互页面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期</td>\n<td><code>applicationDidEnterBackground</code></td>\n<td>保证数据不丢失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络恢复</td>\n<td>从 offline → online</td>\n<td>离线积压数据补传</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本地存储通常使用 SQLite 或 Protocol Buffers 序列化文件。SQLite 的优势在于支持事务（保证写入原子性）和索引（按优先级排序上报）。上报成功后删除对应记录；失败则指数退避重试，最大重试次数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\max} = 5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span>，退避间隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t = t_0 \\cdot 2^{k-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext>s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0 = 1\\text{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为当前重试次数）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"事件优先级与采样\">事件优先级与采样</h2><p>不是所有事件价值相同。核心转化事件（付费、注册）必须 100% 上报；高频低价值事件（滚动、曝光）可以按比例采样以控制数据量和带宽成本。</p>\n<p>采样策略在 SDK 初始化时通过服务端下发的配置决定：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;sampling_rules&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;event_pattern&quot;: &quot;ecommerce_purchase_*&quot;, &quot;rate&quot;: 1.0 },&#10;    { &quot;event_pattern&quot;: &quot;content_*_viewed&quot;, &quot;rate&quot;: 0.5 },&#10;    { &quot;event_pattern&quot;: &quot;scroll_*&quot;, &quot;rate&quot;: 0.1 }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sampling_rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"event_pattern\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ecommerce_purchase_*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"event_pattern\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"content_*_viewed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"event_pattern\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scroll_*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>采样决策应在事件产生时确定并持久化（deterministic sampling），避免同一用户会话内的事件序列被随机割裂。常用做法是对 <code>session_id</code> 取哈希再对采样率取模：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sampled</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mtext>hash</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>session_id</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1000</mn><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mtext>rate</mtext><mo>×</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sampled} = \\bigl(\\text{hash}(\\text{session\\_id}) \\bmod 1000\\bigr) &lt; \\text{rate} \\times 1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sampled</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hash</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">session_id</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mod</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6984em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"埋点治理与质量保障\">埋点治理与质量保障</h2><p>埋点的长期价值取决于治理能力。70% 的应用在 18 个月内需要重建事件结构——根本原因是缺乏治理机制。</p>\n<p><strong>Schema Registry</strong>：所有事件必须先在注册中心声明 schema 才能使用。SDK 侧校验不符合 schema 的事件并拒绝发送（或标记为 <code>invalid</code>）。新增事件需经过产品、工程、数据三方 review。</p>\n<p><strong>埋点验证（QA）</strong>：每次发版前在测试设备上实时查看事件流，确认事件名、参数名、参数类型与 schema 一致。Firebase DebugView、Sentry 的 Event Breadcrumbs、字节跳动的 Tea Debugger 都提供此类实时验证能力。</p>\n<p><strong>死埋点清理</strong>：定期扫描过去 90 天无触发的事件，标记为 deprecated。超过 180 天仍无触发则从 schema registry 移除，SDK 侧停止采集。</p>\n<p><strong>版本兼容</strong>：事件 schema 演进遵循向后兼容原则——只允许新增 optional 字段，不允许删除或重命名已有字段。breaking change 必须创建新事件（如 <code>ecommerce_purchase_completed_v2</code>），老事件保留至所有活跃版本不再发送。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>埋点设计本质上是数据 contract 的工程化。它决定了下游<a href=\"user-behavior-analytics\">用户行为分析</a>和<a href=\"attribution-funnel\">归因漏斗</a>的天花板——垃圾进则垃圾出，再精妙的分析模型也无法弥补采集层的结构性缺陷。核心要点：采用三层命名分类法确保事件名自解释；通过 Schema Registry 和类型校验保障数据质量；批量上报策略平衡实时性与资源消耗；采样和治理机制控制数据规模的可持续性。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"事件埋点设计","id":"事件埋点设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"事件模型与分类法","id":"事件模型与分类法"},{"level":2,"text":"埋点模式：代码埋点、可视化埋点与全埋点","id":"埋点模式-代码埋点-可视化埋点与全埋点"},{"level":2,"text":"客户端 SDK 上报策略","id":"客户端-sdk-上报策略"},{"level":2,"text":"事件优先级与采样","id":"事件优先级与采样"},{"level":2,"text":"埋点治理与质量保障","id":"埋点治理与质量保障"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"用户行为分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/analytics-fundamentals/user-behavior-analytics"}}